                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg343">p. 343</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d337-f3" n="12" xml:id="d337-f3-content">
                <p>Gaston Henry-Haye, French Ambassador in the United States.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d337-f4" n="13" xml:id="d337-f4-content">
                <p>Jacques Barnaud, French delegate general for Franco-German economic
                    negotiations.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
